    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">95 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Mediator + Observer + State</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 41 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Chat Application</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build the core of a WhatsApp-style chat in one sitting: users, 1:1 and group chats, messages with a sequence number per chat, sent / delivered / read ticks per recipient, offline users who get their messages when they reconnect, group admins, late joiners who cannot read old history, and paging. You get the requirements, the class model, the receipt state machine, why the server is a Mediator and each device an Observer, running Java, Python and C++14 code, a 90-minute plan and the follow-ups interviewers push on.</p>\n"
  },
